    {
      "name": "android-mcp",
      "path": "android-mcp/",
      "package": "android-mcp",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "entrypoint": "index.ts",
      "status": "active",
      "requires": [
        "Android SDK Platform-Tools (adb)",
        "Android SDK Emulator + AVD（仅模拟器相关工具）",
        "JDK 17（仅 android_build）",
        "设备侧 ADBKeyboard v2.5-dev（仅中文输入，用 scripts/setup-input-ime.mjs 装；不装则退化成「宿主机剪贴板+粘贴」，只对模拟器有效）"
      ],
      "credentials": [],
      "tools": [
        "android_status",
        "android_device_info",
        "android_foreground",
        "android_prepare",
        "android_start_emulator",
        "android_stop_emulator",
        "android_screenshot",
        "android_dump_ui",
        "android_wait_idle",
        "android_tap",
        "android_swipe",
        "android_long_press",
        "android_double_tap",
        "android_drag",
        "android_input_text",
        "android_press_key",
        "android_wait_for_text",
        "android_install",
        "android_launch_app",
        "android_force_stop",
        "android_uninstall",
        "android_list_packages",
        "android_app_info",
        "android_logcat",
        "android_clear_logcat",
        "android_build",
        "android_list_apks",
        "android_shell"
      ],
      "notes": "ADB + emulator 的封装，让 agent 自己跑完「构建→安装→操作→看结果→读日志」。不自带 SDK：缺 adb 时服务照常启动，android_status 返回可读安装指引。多设备时不猜 serial（避免把操作打到别人手机上）；截图走 exec-out 并校验 PNG 魔数；uiautomator dump 过滤掉 70~80% 噪声节点并预计算中心点坐标。**中文输入**走设备侧 ADBKeyboard 广播（input text 对非 ASCII 会抛 NPE），失败退回宿主机剪贴板+粘贴。**禁区（guardrails.json）**把「哪些地方不许碰」做成配置，工具层强制拦截 tap/launch/shell/input/dump/screenshot，不靠模型记性。android_wait_idle 用「连续两次 dump 一致」替掉 sleep。两个脚本：scripts/setup-input-ime.mjs（装输入法，校验 sha256）、scripts/smoke-device.mjs（真机冒烟，16 项）。详见 android-mcp/README.md。"
    },
    {
      "name": "amap-maps",
      "external": true,
      "source": "npm:@amap/amap-maps-mcp-server",
      "version": "0.0.8",
      "status": "active",
      "runtime": "stdio",
      "launch": "cmd /c npx -y @amap/amap-maps-mcp-server",
      "credentials": [
        "AMAP_MAPS_API_KEY"
      ],
      "tools": [
        "maps_geo",
        "maps_regeocode",
        "maps_ip_location",
        "maps_text_search",
        "maps_around_search",
        "maps_search_detail",
        "maps_distance",
        "maps_direction_walking",
        "maps_direction_bicycling",
        "maps_direction_driving",
        "maps_direction_transit_integrated",
        "maps_weather"
      ],
      "notes": "第三方官方 MCP，非本仓库代码，因此没有本地目录与 entrypoint。建议用 Streamable HTTP 接入（https://mcp.amap.com/mcp?key=<key>）；本机走的是 Node stdio 包（Node >=22.14）。Key 要选「Web服务」平台类型，且只放 .claude.json，不要入库。用法上的坑（同一个路名多候选点能让总长差 6 km、规划器会静默换走法、渡口通航时间看 open_time 等 10 条）见 README「amap-maps 实测踩坑」。"
    },
    {
      "name": "zotero-mcp",
      "external": true,
      "source": "pypi:zotero-mcp-server (github.com/54yyyu/zotero-mcp, MIT)",
      "version": "0.5.0",
      "status": "active",
      "runtime": "http",
      "launch": "已在本地常驻，接入地址 http://127.0.0.1:23120/mcp（Streamable HTTP）",
      "tools": [
        "get_libraries",
        "search_library",
        "search_libraries",
        "search_annotations",
        "get_item_details",
        "get_annotations",
        "get_content",
        "get_collections",
        "search_collections",
        "get_collection_details",
        "get_collection_items",
        "get_subcollections",
        "create_collection",
        "update_collection",
        "delete_collection",
        "add_items_to_collection",
        "remove_items_from_collection",
        "search_fulltext",
        "get_item_abstract",
        "fulltext_database",
        "write_note",
        "write_tag",
        "write_metadata",
        "write_item",
        "add_by_identifier"
      ],
      "notes": "第三方 MCP（54yyyu/zotero-mcp，MIT），非本仓库代码，因此没有本地目录与 entrypoint。本机走 Streamable HTTP，不占本地副本。工具清单取自运行中的服务（tools/list）。⚠️ 其中 create_collection/update_collection/delete_collection/add_items_to_collection/remove_items_from_collection/write_note/write_tag/write_metadata/write_item/add_by_identifier 会**写入 Zotero 库**，与「Zotero 文献库只读」的规矩冲突 —— 只读场景下不要调用。另注：本机另有 upstream 原样克隆在 E:/CodeProject/zotero-mcp，不必也不应 vendor 进本仓库。"
    }
